{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:57607412e6068e21","name":"Antitheft Comlink Locator","source":{"id":"source:reference-57607412e6068e21","title":"Antitheft Comlink Locator","revision":15856,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:20Z","sha256":"71a8578a778dadb56ab416a97003122e5a7480c5bae0ca16ce8367f802534acb","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15856","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Antitheft%20Comlink%20Locator&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-57607412e6068e21","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 100\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," are equipped with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Comlinks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Comlinks"}," to broadcast messages. However, these devices require the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to speak out loud, and in some situations such an act is inadvisable. A Droid equipped with an Antitheft Comlink Locator can send a distress signal to its master's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," with no apparent activity by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},". The distress signal broadcasts no information, but it can it be tracked. The signal continues to broadcast if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is deactivated, but it shuts down if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is destroyed.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
